          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 120 Calgary Nose Hill 3.  My first time to this park.  Lots of activity on a warm Saturday morning.  Cap was a quick find.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
